\`\`\`

=== INSTALARE NEMOCLAW ===

Verifică RAM mai întâi:
\`\`\`bash
free -h
\`\`\`

Dacă < 8GB adaugă swap:
\`\`\`bash
fallocate -l 8G /swapfile && chmod 600 /swapfile && mkswap /swapfile && swapon /swapfile
\`\`\`

Instalare:
