source ~/.bashrc && hermes doctor
\`\`\`
\`\`\`bash
hermes model
\`\`\`

=== DEBUGGING ===

502 Bad Gateway NemoClaw:
\`\`\`bash
openshell forward stop 18789 SANDBOX 2>/dev/null && openshell forward start 18789 SANDBOX --background
\`\`\`

Port ocupat:
\`\`\`bash
fuser -k PORT/tcp
\`\`\`

Serviciu căzut:
\`\`\`bash
journalctl -u SERVICIU -n 20 --no-pager
\`\`\`

